TYPES.md §15: a field default reading its own field through `self`, in a string interpolation, is E3010.
-- a/a.canon --
package a

local record R {
  port: Int = 80
  me: String = "{self.me}"
}
-- findings.txt --
error[E3010]  a/a.canon:5:18
  a default may read only fields declared before it; name an earlier field

1 error, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
